WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:06.600
<v Safi>Teacher, the water beside the lily pad just rippled. Who jumped in?

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:14.989
<v Nuri>Look at the other stone. Can you spot something sitting very still?

00:00:17.689 --> 00:00:22.411
<v Safi>I found a frog! Its back legs are folded beside its body.

00:00:25.511 --> 00:00:30.720
<v Nuri>Make a guess. Where will it land when it stretches out its legs?

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.559
<v Safi>Splash! It landed in the water. The rings are spreading out from where it landed.

00:00:43.659 --> 00:00:48.530
<v Safi>Here is a real frog. Can you see its folded back legs?

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:59.153
<v Safi>I’ll watch from the bank and give the frog space. Thank Allah for creating frogs.
